From: sunuefi-np05j <sunuefi-np05j@local>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/dpu: disable command-mode idle_pc on nubia NP05J

Stock nubia NP05J HX8874 OLED DT disables display HW sleep
(qcom,mdss-disable-cesta-hw-sleep). Leaving DPU idle_pc enabled on the
bonded Dual-DSI command-mode path disconnects external TE during short
idle intervals and causes brief horizontal white-line glitches when rapid
UI motion wakes the link. Disable idle_pc_supported on nubia,np05j.

---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_encoder.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_encoder.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_encoder.c
index 000000000..111111111 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_encoder.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/disp/dpu1/dpu_encoder.c
@@ -2724,8 +2724,10 @@ struct drm_encoder *dpu_encoder_init(struct drm_device *dev,
 
 	DPU_DEBUG("dsi_info->num_of_h_tiles %d\n", disp_info->num_of_h_tiles);
 
-	if (disp_info->intf_type != INTF_WB)
+	if (disp_info->intf_type != INTF_WB &&
+	    !(disp_info->is_cmd_mode && of_machine_is_compatible("nubia,np05j"))) {
 		dpu_enc->idle_pc_supported =
 				dpu_kms->catalog->caps->has_idle_pc;
+	}
 
 	mutex_lock(&dpu_enc->enc_lock);
